WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.962
Check three.

2
00:00:00.962 --> 00:00:05.002
Learn advises letting users run
the client unrestricted first,

3
00:00:05.002 --> 00:00:06.450
and restricting later.

4
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:10.213
So what does the kit do with the four
hardening values during the pilot?

5
00:00:10.213 --> 00:00:12.275
Fail every device without them?

6
00:00:12.275 --> 00:00:15.512
Report them as information,
and check them from ring 2?

7
00:00:15.512 --> 00:00:16.987
Apply them automatically?

8
00:00:16.987 --> 00:00:18.980
Or ignore them in every ring?
